       "id": "16025134"
      },
      {
       "evidenceCode": "ECO:0000269",
       "source": "PubMed",
       "id": "16828797"
      }
     ],
     "value": "Homodimer (PubMed:16025134, PubMed:16828797). Part of a TRAPP complex. Heterodimer with TRAPPC3 (PubMed:16025134, PubMed:16828797). The heterodimer TRAPPC6B-TRAPPC3 interacts with TRAPPC1 likely providing a core for TRAPP complex formation (PubMed:16828797)"
    }
   ],
